            "snippet": "<table class=\"highlight-table\"><tr data-line=\"65\"><td><div class=\"lineno\">65</div></td><td><div class=\"highlight\"><pre>| <span class=\"sb\">`docker-decide`</span> | hashes the build inputs (<span class=\"sb\">`docker/<mark>image_inputs.py</mark>`</span>) and compares. Inputs equal to the base branch → no PR image, suites run on <span class=\"sb\">`dev`</span>. Otherwise it reads the <span class=\"sb\">`miles.image-inputs`</span> label off the published <span class=\"sb\">`pr-&lt;num&gt;`</span> tag: same hash → reuse it, different or absent → rebuild. Fork PRs cannot publish, so they always test on <span class=\"sb\">`dev`</span> |</pre></div></td></tr></table>"
